    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d509">

                <pb facs="0902" n="884" xml:id="pg884"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.501/2–1551</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of Defense</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Marshall</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-02-15">February 15,
                        1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I am forwarding herewith
                    for your information and consideration a memorandum of 9 February 1951 in which
                    the Joint Chiefs of Staff present certain recommendations regarding the National
                    Police Reserve in Japan. I concur in these recommendations and believe that,
                    from the military point of view, they should be put into effect as soon as
                    possible.</p>
                <p>In the light of their international political implications, I would appreciate
                    your views as soon as possible before presenting these recommendations to the
                    President for his approval. In order to hasten consideration of this matter I am
                    attaching for your comment, a draft letter to the President recommending his
                        approval.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d509-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d509-a1.xml" xpointer="d509-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
